+Data Auditor's own script (adapted from my ic_06_static.py); no Executor code imported, called or copied.
+usage: python -I id_06_static.py <repo_root>"""
+import os, sys
+sys.path.insert(0, os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__)))
